{
    "_readme": [
        "BGM replacements for WauLau_ExtendedSoundtrack.",
        "The first matching rule wins: list specific rules before general ones.",
        "from: original song name, or \"_battleBgm\" for whatever battle BGM starts a battle.",
        "to: audio fields to use instead (omitted volume/pitch/pan keep the original's).",
        "variants: [{ \"when\": ..., \"name\": ... }] songs played instead while \"when\" holds;",
        "   the first that holds plays, and it crossfades on the map when conditions change.",
        "   when: { \"switch\": 12 } ON | { \"switch\": 12, \"is\": false } OFF |",
        "   { \"variable\": 5, \">=\": 2 } (also is, not, >, <, <=) | [cond, cond] all must hold.",
        "night: shorthand for a variant at night (var 122 >= 2), checked after variants.",
        "Optional conditions (number or array of numbers):",
        "map, event (pair with map), commonEvent, troop,",
        "page (1-based as in the editor; pair with map + event, or with troop),",
        "channel (0 = main BGM, 1+ = MUSH channel incl. spatial BGM; omitted = both).",
        "   MUSH channels pick their variant once at start; spatial \"to.volume\" = max volume.",
        "Examples:",
        "{ ",
        "   \"from\": \"OriginalSong\"",
        "   \"to\": { \"name\": \"NewSong\", \"volume\": 80 }, \"map\": 56, \"event\": 3 ",
        "}",
        "{",
        "   \"from\": \"BattleSong\",",
        "   \"to\": { \"name\": \"NewBattleSong\" },",
        "   \"troop\": [12, 13]",
        "}",
        "{",
        "   \"from\": \"OriginalSong\",",
        "   \"night\": { \"name\": \"OriginalSong_Night\" },",
        "   \"commonEvent\": 46",
        "}",
        "{",
        "   \"from\": \"OriginalSong\",",
        "   \"variants\": [",
        "      { \"when\": { \"switch\": 150 }, \"name\": \"OriginalSong_Horror\" },",
        "      { \"when\": { \"variable\": 30, \">=\": 3 }, \"name\": \"OriginalSong_Late\", \"pitch\": 90 }",
        "   ],",
        "   \"night\": { \"name\": \"OriginalSong_Night\" }",
        "}",
        "",
        "pageBgm: songs played when a troop or map event page starts or ends,",
        "   even if the page plays no BGM itself. Replacement rules still apply to them.",
        "play: audio fields of the song. at: \"start\" (default) or \"end\".",
        "troop, or map + event: required. page: optional (omitted = any page).",
        "when: optional condition (same format as variants).",
        "{ \"play\":",
        "   { \"name\": \"Fight\" }",
        "   \"troop\":21",
        "   \"page\": 1",
        "   \"at\": \"end\"",
        "}"
    ],
